al model estimate of the same quantity the market pays on (monthly or year-over-year CPI percent change, BLS being the series' named settlement source). It is deliberately compared within a margin: the nowcast is a model, and the market resolves on the BLS print, so the edge has to survive both the margin and the fees."}}
